@startuml component-diagram
title Nearby — Component Diagram

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

actor "User / Organization" as Actor

package "Client tier" {
  [Expo App\n(iOS / Android / web)] as CMP01
}

package "Server tier" {
  [Main Server\n(NestJS)\nuser requests + matching] as CMP02
  [Notification Service\npush, SMS / Telegram] as CMP03
  [Event Import Service] as CMP04
  database "PostgreSQL" as CMP05
}

cloud "External systems" {
  [Event providers\n(Concert.ua, ArtWizard)] as EXT01
  [Expo Push] as EXT02
  [SMS / Telegram] as EXT03
}

Actor --> CMP01
CMP01 --> CMP02 : REST / HTTPS (TLS 1.2+)

CMP02 --> CMP05 : read / write,\nqueue outbound message
CMP03 --> CMP05 : LISTEN / NOTIFY,\nread message queue
CMP04 --> CMP05 : upsert events

EXT01 --> CMP04 : provider API / import
CMP03 --> EXT02 : push notifications\n(FR-023, FR-024)
CMP03 --> EXT03 : verification codes\n(FR-005, SEC-008)

note right of CMP03
  Owns all outbound communication.
  Woken by NOTIFY, not polling —
  SEC-008 allows p95 <= 2 s.
end note

note bottom of CMP05
  Single shared schema.
  Services hand work to each other
  through the database, not over HTTP.
end note

@enduml
